            "state": "dated_estimate",
            "construction_note": "Building 1 looks close to finishing construction, with chillers in place. OpenAI [stated](https://openai.com/index/five-new-stargate-sites/) that \"Oracle began delivering the first NVIDIA GB200 racks in June.\" The \"tenant improvement\" work [is not due](https://www.tdlr.texas.gov/TABS/Search/Project/TABS2025000156) until September, however.",
