            "state": "dated_estimate",
            "construction_note": "Building 2 is fully operational. This exact date corresponds to the expected completion date of \"Four (4) data hall spaces and an administrative office build-out\" according to a [TDLR filing](https://www.tdlr.texas.gov/TABS/Search/Project/TABS2025007742), but this date is also consistent with satellite imagery. By January 15, Building 2 looked as finished as Building 1, whereas on September 26 it did not look finished.",
